text: >-
  200% •

  Normal text

  Arial

  12

  2024

  January 3rd: Mikey McCoy promoted to Chief of Staff [Internal e-mail]

  February 8th: Charlie's campus tour is publicly announced (w/ Candace)

  February 9th: BTT from Cairo to Paris to Omaha Nebraska (lands in Nebraska at

  10:57am) flies right over to Lincoln, Nebraska and stays in Lincoln for 5
  days.

  February 11th: Turning Point USA begins a chapter in Lincoln, Nebraska

  February 14th: BTT Depart on the 14th at 8:38am for Wilmington. Stays in
  Wilmington

  for two days and then heads back to Cairo on the 16th

  March 29th: BTT departs Cairo, heads via Paris to Wichita, Kansas, lands at
  2:19pm

  April 3rd: **Charlie was at the University of Kansas on April 3rd

  April 3rd: departs Kansas at 8:43am back to Wilmington-left on April 5th to
  Cairo

  April 9th: Charlie is in Omaha, Nebraska speaking at Lord of Hosts Church

  April 19th: BND comes from Provo via Paris to Salt Lake City then continues
  onto

  Provo. Lands at 3:33pm local time
